[["page","lines",0],{"text":"750 MOSLEMI ET AL .","fontSize":6.9738,"x":45.519,"y":21.02609999999993,"width":503.9914456,"height":6.973799999999983}]
[["page","lines",1],{"text":"C H A R T 1 Comparison of dermatitis","fontSize":7.9701,"x":387.123,"y":47.2278,"width":136.72068595000013,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",2],{"text":"percentage during 5 weeks of radiotherapy in","fontSize":7.9701,"x":386.52923,"y":58.18988000000002,"width":156.6347812800003,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",3],{"text":"the sesame oil group (case) and the placebo","fontSize":7.9701,"x":386.52923,"y":69.14317999999992,"width":148.96116900000004,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",4],{"text":"group (control).","fontSize":7.9701,"x":386.52923,"y":80.10525999999993,"width":53.662683299999685,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",5],{"text":"ineffectiveness of creams in preventing radiation dermatitis in either","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51973,"y":226.84993999999995,"width":242.7684489899996,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",6],{"text":"delaying or inhibiting skin reactions.","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51973,"y":239.80056000000002,"width":122.9356044599999,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",7],{"text":"25","fontSize":5.9776,"x":168.468,"y":238.92239999999993,"width":6.932222725977624,"height":5.977600000000052}]
[["page","lines",8],{"text":"A significant positive correlation","fontSize":7.9701,"x":177.108,"y":239.80089999999996,"width":111.19325613000001,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",9],{"text":"was observed between the oil content of sesame seed and the sesamin","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51926,"y":252.7515199999999,"width":242.76446394000018,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",10],{"text":"content in the oil. According to the research, the topical use of SO might","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51926,"y":265.70213,"width":242.6951240699997,"height":7.970099999999945}]
[["page","lines",11],{"text":"reduce oxidative stress by inhibiting the production of xanthine oxi-","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51926,"y":278.65274999999997,"width":242.78359217999983,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",12],{"text":"dase and nitric oxide in rats. Orally administered SO, in a rat model of","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51926,"y":291.60335999999995,"width":242.7612758999999,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",13],{"text":"monosodium urate monohydrate crystal-induced acute inflammatory","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51926,"y":304.55397999999997,"width":242.76366693000014,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",14],{"text":"response in a pseudo-synovial cavity, reduces inflammation. In a clini-","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51926,"y":317.50458999999995,"width":242.80590845999964,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",15],{"text":"cal study by Bigdeli Shamloo et al. topical application of SO lowered the","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51926,"y":330.45520999999997,"width":242.7756220800001,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",16],{"text":"severity of pain and the frequency of nonsteroidal anti-inflammatory","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51926,"y":343.41538999999995,"width":242.75011776000022,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",17],{"text":"drug use in patients with limb trauma. These findings are consistent","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51926,"y":356.366,"width":242.74692972000005,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",18],{"text":"with those of the present study, thus confirming the effectiveness","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51926,"y":369.31661999999994,"width":242.7572908500001,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",19],{"text":"of SO.","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51926,"y":382.26723,"width":20.704725780000018,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",20],{"text":"Kong et al. (2016) studied the effectiveness and safety of traditional","fontSize":7.9701,"x":55.48188,"y":395.21784999999994,"width":232.7803196700001,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",21],{"text":"Jaungo ointment in preventing radiation therapy dermatitis and pain","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51926,"y":408.16846999999996,"width":242.78518619999969,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",22],{"text":"in 30 patients. They determined that the rate of patients suffering","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51926,"y":421.11907999999994,"width":242.75729085000015,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",23],{"text":"from grade two (46.7 vs. 76.8%) and grade three (20 vs. 50%) dermati-","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51926,"y":434.06969999999995,"width":242.77482507000016,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",24],{"text":"tis decreased. Abbaszadeh et al. through a double-blind, randomized","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51926,"y":447.02030999999994,"width":242.7652609499997,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",25],{"text":"controlled trial, studied the effect of Recove (burn lotion-containing","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51926,"y":459.97092999999995,"width":242.76526094999977,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",26],{"text":"SO as a component) on acute radio dermatitis in BC patients.","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51926,"y":472.92153999999994,"width":242.75649383999988,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",27],{"text":"According to their results, patients in the Recove lotion-treated group","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51926,"y":485.87215999999995,"width":242.78438918999953,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",28],{"text":"showed scaling with no necrosis in the sub-scaled area. Given that","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51926,"y":498.82277,"width":242.77402805999978,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",29],{"text":"Recove may prevent radio dermatitis and the clinical evidence show","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51926,"y":511.77338999999995,"width":242.7556968299996,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",30],{"text":"allergic potential in SO, SO of Recove may be regarded as the cause of","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51926,"y":524.7239999999999,"width":242.76765197999978,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",31],{"text":"scaling of dead tissues, allowing skin regeneration.","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51926,"y":537.67462,"width":177.25661801999973,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",32],{"text":"31-33","fontSize":5.9776,"x":222.792,"y":536.8044,"width":15.932695040000027,"height":5.9775999999999385}]
[["page","lines",33],{"text":"The only side","fontSize":7.9701,"x":241.449,"y":537.6829,"width":46.8609999599999,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",34],{"text":"effect that we find in our review for topical SO was allergic reaction","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51923,"y":550.63352,"width":233.3326475999997,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",35],{"text":"34","fontSize":5.9776,"x":278.871,"y":549.7644,"width":6.932222725977567,"height":5.9775999999999385}]
[["page","lines",36],{"text":";","fontSize":7.9701,"x":286.305,"y":550.6338999999999,"width":2.008465199999989,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",37],{"text":"however, in our study, we find no allergic or adverse effect in the con-","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51951,"y":563.58452,"width":242.76526094999994,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",38],{"text":"trol group that should be evaluated in studies with higher number of","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51951,"y":576.53513,"width":242.76605796000015,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",39],{"text":"cases.","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51951,"y":589.4857499999999,"width":20.542932750000006,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",40],{"text":"Publications show different findings regarding how to manage radio","fontSize":7.9701,"x":55.48214,"y":602.43716,"width":232.8161851199996,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",41],{"text":"dermatitis; however, no gold standard treatment or prevention exists.","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51951,"y":615.39734,"width":242.75569683000012,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",42],{"text":"For the first time, this study investigated the effect of SO in treat-","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51951,"y":628.34795,"width":242.78598320999967,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",43],{"text":"ing and preventing radio dermatitis. The study was only conducted in","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51951,"y":641.2985699999999,"width":242.77402806000018,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",44],{"text":"one radiotherapy center, and there was a cultural limitation in which","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51951,"y":654.24919,"width":242.78359217999989,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",45],{"text":"patients did not want to participate in medical studies. Some patients","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51951,"y":667.1998,"width":242.77402805999972,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",46],{"text":"initially denied undergoing even primary assessment as written con-","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51951,"y":680.1504199999999,"width":242.77163702999982,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",47],{"text":"sent was essential in the study. This study investigated SO as a new","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51951,"y":693.1010299999999,"width":242.7748250700001,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",48],{"text":"substance in treating acute dermatitis caused by radiotherapy. Based","fontSize":7.9701,"x":45.51951,"y":706.05165,"width":242.78837423999968,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",49],{"text":"on the findings, SO, as a cheap and available herbal treatment, may be","fontSize":7.9701,"x":306.73476,"y":226.84699,"width":242.7684489900003,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",50],{"text":"utilized in treating acute dermatitis caused by radiotherapy.","fontSize":7.9701,"x":306.73476,"y":239.79760999999996,"width":205.1981946000006,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",51],{"text":"35-37","fontSize":5.9776,"x":511.953,"y":238.92239999999993,"width":15.932695039999885,"height":5.977600000000052}]
[["page","lines",52],{"text":"However, the most common skin reaction occurs approximately","fontSize":7.9701,"x":316.698,"y":252.75189999999998,"width":232.81140305999975,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",53],{"text":"10–14 days after starting treatment and often gets progressively","fontSize":7.9701,"x":306.73537,"y":265.70251999999994,"width":242.77960712999993,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",54],{"text":"worse over the course of treatment.","fontSize":7.9701,"x":306.73537,"y":278.65313,"width":127.74476303113329,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",55],{"text":"4","fontSize":5.9776,"x":434.499,"y":277.7754,"width":3.467008000000021,"height":5.977599999999995}]
[["page","lines",56],{"text":"We cannot change the method","fontSize":7.9701,"x":440.754,"y":278.65389999999996,"width":108.74802944999999,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",57],{"text":"but this small short-term follow-up study can be a guide for further","fontSize":7.9701,"x":306.73517,"y":291.60531,"width":242.75808785999965,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",58],{"text":"investigations.","fontSize":7.9701,"x":306.73517,"y":304.55672,"width":50.08809345000026,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",59],{"text":"It is suggested to conduct a study considering the pain level of","fontSize":7.9701,"x":316.6978,"y":317.50733999999994,"width":232.80980904000018,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",60],{"text":"patients in two groups and examining the difference after consuming","fontSize":7.9701,"x":306.73517,"y":330.45795999999996,"width":242.7469297199994,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",61],{"text":"SO. Further, an investigation with a larger sample size in several cen-","fontSize":7.9701,"x":306.73517,"y":343.41813999999994,"width":242.7636669300004,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",62],{"text":"ters should be conducted to investigate the effects of SO in treating","fontSize":7.9701,"x":306.73517,"y":356.36875,"width":242.7572908499996,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",63],{"text":"acute radio dermatitis. A study to investigate the effectiveness of SO","fontSize":7.9701,"x":306.73517,"y":369.31937,"width":242.77721610000032,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",64],{"text":"in the severity of acute radio dermatitis with a longer follow-up period","fontSize":7.9701,"x":306.73517,"y":382.26998,"width":242.77323105,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",65],{"text":"is also proposed. In conclusion, the present trial showed SO lotion to","fontSize":7.9701,"x":306.73517,"y":395.2206,"width":242.75489981999948,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",66],{"text":"have a significant therapeutic impact on radio dermatitis in patients","fontSize":7.9701,"x":306.73517,"y":408.17121,"width":242.7572908500003,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",67],{"text":"with BC. However, more research is required to support the evidence","fontSize":7.9701,"x":306.73517,"y":421.12183,"width":242.7748250700002,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",68],{"text":"of the beneficial effects of SO.","fontSize":7.9701,"x":306.73517,"y":434.07244,"width":103.23112622999969,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",69],{"text":"5 CLINICAL PRACTICE POINTS","fontSize":9.9626,"x":306.735,"y":473.42839999999995,"width":160.53977970000034,"height":9.962600000000009}]
[["page","lines",70],{"text":"This study investigated SO as a new substance in the treatment of","fontSize":7.9701,"x":306.735,"y":501.32289999999995,"width":242.76765197999964,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",71],{"text":"acute dermatitis caused by radiotherapy. Based on the findings, SO, as a","fontSize":7.9701,"x":306.735,"y":514.27352,"width":242.7309895199994,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",72],{"text":"cheap and available herbal treatment, may be utilized in treating acute","fontSize":7.9701,"x":306.735,"y":527.22413,"width":242.75011776000008,"height":7.970100000000002}]
[["page","lines",73],{"text":"dermatitis caused by radiotherapy.","fontSize":7.9701,"x":306.735,"y":540.1747499999999,"width":119.47737807000033,"height":7.970100000000002}]
